# OpenClaw (this repo)

This repo is the **portal + contract**, not AWS. Infra is `sam-terraform`. Do not add Fargate, RDS, or a public API Gateway.

## Isolation

Access is **sandbox membership**. v1 `tenantId` equals `sandboxId`. Never trust `tenantId`, `agentId`, or `model` from the client. Resolve tenant from the sandbox row on the server.

## UX

- Local: Next.js `apps/portal` — `/admin`, `/sandboxes`, `/insights`
- Hosted: [`site/index.html`](site/index.html) at `https://portal.halcyonlabs.uk` (prod, gated) and `https://staging-portal.halcyonlabs.uk`. Workspace `#/` / `#/workspace`. Insights `#/insights`. Hash `#/admin` is Access (grant sandboxes) for allowlisted Cognito admins. Gold-on-black Halcyon chrome. Not `staging.halcyonlabs.uk` (marketing preview). Not the Next.js BFF.
- No sandbox membership → labelled Sample workspace in the hosted SPA (in-page only). Do not seed Dynamo for a tenant the caller does not belong to.

## Telemetry

Prompts and responses must not be stored on AWS. Workspace history may live encrypted in this browser’s IndexedDB (AES-GCM, per sandbox + agent), or memory-only. Stamp events with `@halcyon/telemetry`. Sidecar `telemetry` is never forwarded to browsers.

## CI

One npm job: `npm ci`, audit, `npm test`, portal build, `scripts/package-spa.sh`. Do not add AWS deploy workflows here.

Inference hosts (Studio/WSL): sibling **`bootstrap-ollama`**. This repo keeps the Gateway **template** only.

Read [`.cursor/architecture.md`](.cursor/architecture.md) only when changing the lake or BI product shape.
